{"id":"e74e91145cf2af1e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction.md","title":"简单类型在β归约下保持","display":"thm-stlc-subject-reduction — 简单类型在β归约下保持","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction","aliases":["72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction"],"display":"thm-stlc-subject-reduction — 简单类型在β归约下保持","depends_on":["[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","[[72-lem-stlc-substitution]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §§3.1–3.4 print15–18/PDF23–26 freshly rechecked; local derivation below","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stlc-subject-reduction — 简单类型在β归约下保持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"790cb6137e1847d0\" href=\"?note=790cb6137e1847d0\" title=\"72-lem-stlc-substitution\">72-lem-stlc-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §§3.1–3.4 print15–18/PDF23–26 freshly rechecked; local derivation below"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\lambda\">\\(\\beta_\\lambda\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda_\\to\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda_\\to\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\lambda^*\">\\(\\beta_\\lambda^*\\)</span> 为同一项载体上的有限反身传递闭包，包含任意合法单孔context中的β收缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda^*\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda^*\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>根可约式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda x:B.P)Q\">\\((\\lambda x:B.P)Q\\)</span> 的typing反演给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash P:A\">\\(\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash P:A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash Q:B\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash Q:B\\)</span>，代入引理给归约结果的同一类型。在应用左、应用右和抽象体context中，对归约位置归纳并重新应用原typing规则。最后按有限归约长度归纳得到闭包形式。类型保持不单独证明终止或合流。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-stlc-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"790cb6137e1847d0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-stlc-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A$ 与 $\\beta_\\lambda$ 取 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]；$M,N\\in\\Lambda_\\to$、$A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\Lambda_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda^*\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\to N:A.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\lambda x:B.P)Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:B\\vdash P:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash Q:B","display":false}],"bytes":1841,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-483","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction|thm-stlc-subject-reduction — 简单类型在β归约下保持]]"},{"id":"3a355fde5140d919","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：正规形的原类型由 [[72-thm-stlc-subject-reduction]] 沿有限归约保持。强正规化本身仍继承原文献陈述核对的证据边界，没有借这一局部元理论升级完整强正规化证明。"}],"outgoing":["e38d92d6727e7ead","790cb6137e1847d0"]}